<title>USA: TABLE - IMC Global Inc sells $150 mln debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - IMC Global Inc sells $150 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from IMC Global Inc was priced Thursday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>IMC Global Inc produces phosphate rock, potash, phosphates.</p>
<p>BORROWER IMC GLOBAL INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.875 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.82   FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 6.90 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD +71 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
